Open Checking Tools (Apache License 2.0)
----------------------------------------

So that anyone can check ZLAR's records without trusting ZLAR, the files listed
below are licensed under the Apache License 2.0, not under the terms above. The
license text is at LICENSES/Apache-2.0-prior-public.txt.

The checking tool, and the verifier kit that tools/build-verifier-kit.sh builds
from these files:

    tools/verifier-kit-src/
    tools/build-verifier-kit.sh
    bin/zlar-verify
    lib/receipt.mjs
    lib/canonicalize.mjs
    lib/semantic-validator.mjs
    lib/sig-verify.mjs
    lib/downstream-recognition-rule.mjs
    lib/issuer-status-proof.mjs

The written rules:

    spec/governed-action-receipt-v1.md
    spec/CONFORMANCE.md
    spec/verify-test-vectors.mjs
    spec/test-key.pub
    spec/trusted-receipt-issuers-v1.schema.json
    spec/trusted-receipt-issuers-v2.schema.json
    docs/canonicalization-spec.md

The force field's record format and its check:

    cyan/receipt.mjs
    cyan/canonical.mjs

Everything else in this repository, including the force field itself, remains
under the terms above. Later versions of the files listed here are covered by
this section while they remain listed.

